            <div xml:id="m-5012158e-a64c-4f8b-92b4-a7c32a0a1752">
              <lg xml:id="m-1a51abd4-5ce0-421f-981f-30694080d6b0">
                <l xml:id="m-427297ca-bf07-45a0-9519-d2a236d8a4cd" facs="#m-4e1f9512-701a-4120-8284-6b9263c4d680" label="ambiguous">Nisi Dominus. 8. G, Gt, c. — Beati omnes. 4. E. 177</l><l xml:id="m-5da86c5d-508a-442c-80a8-b7f7f868ca3e" facs="#m-8fe79292-0c06-465a-a7ca-022fc6a61925" label="lyrics-like">2. Nisi Dóminus custodierit elvitâtem, * frustra vigilat qui custódit</l><l xml:id="m-d5ad321b-3885-4385-a9f7-45cf4839dfe9" facs="#m-13d091e3-0dd0-4e22-ac2f-29fa6ca389a1" label="lyrics-like">éam.</l><l xml:id="m-d9f1657c-909e-41c6-be16-7124a6869114" facs="#m-49f564d1-241c-43f3-8235-5b6ac91c5a56" label="lyrics-like">3. Vánum est vóbis ante lúcem súrgere: “súrgite postquam sedé¬</l><l xml:id="m-c0784a32-6671-401d-99dd-0aec9542589d" facs="#m-3fc7842e-e389-43dd-b0a0-67966ec8dd46" label="lyrics-like">ritis, qui manducátis pánem dolóris.</l><l xml:id="m-6c4b7aa2-2062-47c1-add1-b980616dcf9e" facs="#m-5bcc7cad-2816-418a-965f-08504e3a23b9" label="lyrics-like">4. Cum déderit diléctis súis sómnum :* ecce haeréditas Dómini, filii:</l><l xml:id="m-fc3bf2d0-436d-4141-a288-c38ca29fb5fb" facs="#m-b3b69ab5-992f-4b26-908a-c0988cbffc18" label="lyrics-like">mérces, frúctus véntris.</l><l xml:id="m-5b582bd4-7e51-4d95-89a6-2b241a6855d8" facs="#m-db2d45b9-f6cb-4be4-8b1c-9d0778627f5d" label="lyrics-like">5. Sicut sagittae in mánu poténtis: *ita filii excussórum.</l><l xml:id="m-1935bf47-edeb-4ac8-b173-f16b4f669433" facs="#m-32770289-66e5-46c7-b3b7-fdc7da4e2fd2" label="lyrics-like">6. Beátus vir qui implévit desidérium súum ex ipsis:"non confun¬</l><l xml:id="m-67fd5280-7c1d-4f50-9eb6-79498fefb779" facs="#m-50b371c0-a64a-44c6-ac0d-d241c76b4fe1" label="lyrics-like">détur cum loquétur inimicis súis in pórta.</l><l xml:id="m-d32c41b1-6d46-4ce8-94b7-9a544f8aae4e" facs="#m-690167c4-ec98-47e0-ad4a-330816a537ba" label="lyrics-like">7. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-5e611579-5ee0-4d92-b1f9-da04e0eba962" facs="#m-c7fca8f4-5f37-46d0-9b68-369451e80382" label="lyrics-like">8. Sicut érat in princípio, et núne, et sémper, *et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-820af202-bd1c-4888-97c0-b0579e0d27b5" facs="#m-4817d727-054d-4c0c-a335-86824fd31cf1" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-1ac7c0c8-891b-4661-947c-93210945d0e7" facs="#m-23e773a1-cb5e-4136-9876-f28f6605f4fe" label="ambiguous">Tone 8. G, Gt, c.</l><l xml:id="m-4c3bd8a2-ab4b-416e-9eeb-3d012e678d04" facs="#m-2cfcd948-e41d-456d-b1a9-d99c84b381f2" label="text-like">Mediant of 1 accent.</l><l xml:id="m-efe47954-77db-4066-9206-53161b81088c" facs="#m-272fa40b-5fd9-490b-ba22-e7bc7004e3b1" label="text-like">Endings of 1 accent with 2 prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-9f37660e-4f1a-4a61-8e62-05db7d6ccf69" facs="#m-3bb12665-5b03-4861-b10b-7afefc61d8e5" label="ambiguous">tory syllables.</l><l xml:id="m-1491098b-079c-48cd-b14f-5e05bafa2140" facs="#m-06cb5d13-7634-4c50-a4f9-f0ef8197fc54" label="lyrics-like">1. Ni-si Dóminus aedi-ficáve-rit dò-mum, * in vánum laboravérunt qui</l><l xml:id="m-cc5dd23c-67e1-4c3c-8228-281b623df2de" facs="#m-00fa7c59-193a-470f-acf5-77070ac8f023" label="ambiguous">Ga</l><l xml:id="m-56f00465-d29f-4b7a-9ae3-08e634de1cf8" facs="#m-08b7a6c6-37a2-4a69-911d-a6f8b0fd0484" label="ambiguous">G</l><l xml:id="m-5d26c454-db3f-4b35-b23f-de394f23dc7d" facs="#m-7cf39ef3-91db-488e-9745-3cc8749a8891" label="lyrics-like">aedí-ficant é¬ am. or: é- am. or: aedi-ficant é- am.</l><l xml:id="m-a831dad4-ce54-4e4f-bbd8-9b82f9caaba1" facs="#m-04a5039d-d010-4e46-9f61-21429e3c1c1f" label="lyrics-like">2. Nisi Dóminus custodierit civitâtem, * frustra vígilat qui custóau</l><l xml:id="m-2b98dce3-8b08-4561-aee7-784a3992c848" facs="#m-88e517d4-6783-488e-9184-a0306ef18386" label="lyrics-like">éam.</l><l xml:id="m-2d19946b-2103-4fc9-ac6d-02e5ed17e31e" facs="#m-343fdd00-e2f1-4715-90d1-83d3e747b027" label="lyrics-like">3. Vánum est vóbis ante lúcem súrgere:“ súrgite postquam sedéritis,</l><l xml:id="m-745cf241-1fbf-42f0-9ef9-1aa763c8e643" facs="#m-db8ce37f-7709-4a1c-9516-e5239b304b85" label="lyrics-like">qui manducátis pânem aolóris.</l><l xml:id="m-418f059d-6efa-42d7-8031-789ead291bcd" facs="#m-1d795d1d-7d33-4e3c-8a39-0a7674f6074e" label="lyrics-like">4. Cum déderit diléctis súis sómnum :“* ecce haeréditas Dómini, filii:</l><l xml:id="m-21f25367-67e9-4681-834b-c65c21e1bbc4" facs="#m-1eceed2a-3110-46fe-8741-328e18d563b6" label="lyrics-like">mérces, frúctus véntris.</l><l xml:id="m-be1969f6-b2f0-4026-8736-3b2735a10e47" facs="#m-4bf5fda3-0eb6-418d-b6bd-00e3a52300e2" label="lyrics-like">5. Sicut sagittae in mánu poténtis: *ita filii excussórum.</l><l xml:id="m-db72ce72-6982-47bf-8473-75b1fb8ad1ce" facs="#m-bb227d85-1169-48e0-b2e8-d022cd4e00bc" label="lyrics-like">6. Beátus vir qui implévit desidérium súum ex ipsis: * non confun¬</l><l xml:id="m-8f3d9787-64a8-4393-8381-372552fbe204" facs="#m-a8fad611-fcdf-4ace-8a10-5ddaa713585c" label="lyrics-like">détur cum loquétur inimicis súis in pórta.</l><l xml:id="m-74847a9b-9604-4724-b011-19efabb7d624" facs="#m-80eb0b51-c0ee-46a6-a06f-1de8d064933d" label="lyrics-like">7. Glória Pátri, et Filio, *et Spiritai sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-fc5153d5-e841-4ca6-a1bd-10c0bc602783" facs="#m-f8e32b89-9c55-4495-8282-5b7ead1c7ca5" label="lyrics-like">8. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d231aa6-8ffc-4101-8c2e-068637b3a133" facs="#m-ee97509e-de8d-4fb9-90af-4bdcd2006ff4" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-374081da-50e7-436a-979e-40491fc7aff6" facs="#m-d2a1c6f4-d0a8-4231-8ad9-85e359e85f6d" label="ambiguous">Psalm 127. Beati omnes.</l><l xml:id="m-1d372884-430e-4908-92f1-93a5fb04c9fe" facs="#m-edc67649-3c30-4933-9a7d-a06064968385" label="ambiguous">Tone 4. E.</l><l xml:id="m-6fd288fc-0a40-43d4-bc2b-fe913cbed9cc" facs="#m-87f5920e-eddd-4a96-817d-bdb4f4e1dec9" label="text-like">Mediant of 1 accent with z preparatory Ending of 1 accent with 3 prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-913c7f0f-66c4-457f-9aa7-def01c2054c3" facs="#m-c87c2707-b216-4873-ae9d-6cde39599895" label="ambiguous">sllables.</l><l xml:id="m-b625a75c-f3e4-4a0d-9096-5d728592ae46" facs="#m-ea621d5f-f0ea-4be3-ab19-775d2b476616" label="text-like">tory syllables (and an extra note is</l><l xml:id="m-7c9198ed-4ecf-478a-bf35-713303a3ba4e" facs="#m-f073d6a8-fc45-4775-ae32-b43b78c0f25f" label="text-like">added in anticipation of the accent in</l><l xml:id="m-4937a1b2-757f-4c3b-b0bc-ab8553d4f932" facs="#m-e031ec01-5e14-47b1-b90d-80f4dc16c0a3" label="ambiguous">dactylic cadences).</l><l xml:id="m-d88f31c2-b4dd-4c07-8e39-958698dde397" facs="#m-ab266675-cd94-41c5-98c0-3fa57a50c9db" label="ambiguous">—E</l><l xml:id="m-675641e3-2df5-4c8a-a129-e9ce5751091f" facs="#m-71002353-13c2-464e-b8e4-cc88b20e8a45" label="lyrics-like">!. Be-á-ti ómnes qui timent Dóminum, * qui ámbu-lant in vi¬is é-jus.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>